  "assets": [
    {
      "id": "approved-mark",
      "name": "Approved monogram — authored input fixture",
      "file": "assets/approved-mark.svg"
    }
  ],
  "active": "signal",
  "notes": "Retain the supplied mark byte-for-byte. It is an original fixture made for this acceptance brief, not a client asset.\nVoice: clear, specific and practical. Explain the work instead of claiming guaranteed performance.\nUse a dark technical grid as structure, not as decoration behind body text. Green identifies key decisions; paper-colored type carries detail.\nContact details are fictional and must be replaced for a real launch.",
